Package: com.supremeinspirit.liquidassreworked
Name: Liquid (Gl)ass Reworked fixes (test41)
Version: 4~test41
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: The Reworked test41 fixes (test38 + the held or slowly dragged selection drop of the floating tab bar is taller and the fast one flatter; the selection drop of the floating tab bar keeps its size while it slides under the finger and only swings when its size changes; test38 = test37 + the whole floating tab bar swings back from its pressed size after a release; test37 = test33 + the selection drop of the floating tab bar has the sizes of the system's own glass tab bar: big and nearly round while pressed, the same on a slow drag, flatter and longer the faster it travels; after a release the resting pill behind the selected tab arrives with a springy swing; test33 = test32 + the light edge of the floating tab bar follows the tilt in apps when Specular Motion is on; test32 = test29 + text bars drawn with the glass and the pill shape of the Spotlight Search Bar, their light edge follows the tilt when Specular Motion is on; the selection drop of the floating tab bar moves as a spring, changes its size with its motion and leans towards the finger; test29 = test23 + Control Center sliders: the white fill keeps its round ends while a slider module opens and closes, and the expanded sliders have no line at the top left; test23 = no round background behind the glyph of the Control Center Focus module; test22 = Control Center: coloured brightness and volume slider glyphs, no white circle on an active Focus; Dynamic Island: no dark box behind the audio waves during a call, through the new library LiquidAssFixCall for InCallService; test21 = the Dynamic Island glass keeps the card shape when the island opens into the player or another card, instead of becoming an ellipse; test19/20 = the island glass opens without flicker; test18 = "Clear Camera Pill" also clears the resting Dynamic Island, liquid glass on the text loupe and on search fields / Safari's address bar, with the settings pages "Text Loupe" and "Text Bars") as an add-on for the original Liquid (Gl)ass 0.1.1-2b by dylv (winaviation-tweaks). Install it on top of the original. arm64, rootless.
Maintainer: supremeinspirit
Author: supremeinspirit (fixes), dylv (original Liquid (Gl)ass)
Section: Tweaks
Depends: dylv.liquidass, firmware (>= 15.0)
